<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India slump in August.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India slump in August.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official re-exports of silver from the Gulf Arab trading hub of Dubai to India fell to 48.28 tonnes in August from 88.85 tonnes the previous month, figures compiled by Dubai customs showed on Sunday.</p>
<p>Re-export trade was hit by poor trading arbitrages and growing direct silver sales to India, Dubai traders said.</p>
</text>
